From 50d90934e55454ea1617d3f35f8db0d20a5d885a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: prettymebenneth <prettymebenneth@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:42:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ios17: audio, touch, Wi-Fi, display and identity bring-up
 (checkpoint 2)

Kernel side (package/, drivers/):
- ADSP firmware load from the modem partition, GLINK/QRTR/GPR/AudioReach, CS35L41 amplifiers
  (eGPIO reset, GENI I2C recovery) and the ShengAudio service with HAL diagnostics rows.
- FTS touch, NativeHidInput, buttons, Wi-Fi (MHI/firmware), CPU frequency and framebuffer probes.
- BootWatchdogPolicy: Data skeleton from a string pool; managed DictationLanguagesEnabled.

Audio server plug-in (hal/ShengAudioPlugIn.c), arm64e:
- Rebinds VirtualAudio's __auth_got imports (IA key, slot address) for MobileGestalt answers,
  fopen/IORegistry paths, C++ throws and its os_log error lines (IOKit beacons "ShengVA:").
- Presents the device as VirtualAudio's "Codec" with 8 output channels and mute/volume controls
  on output element 4, so the D73 routing database builds the Built-In Speaker port.
- AID8006 graph configuration without speaker_* entries is generated at build time from the
  owner's OS volume (Apple's file is not committed).

iOS 17 overlay (ios17/overlay): ADT product-id/acoustic-id of the real D73AP device tree,
375x812 logical display, status bar library with layout and audio route probes, build scripts.
Submodule changes are carried as source patches in ios17/submodule-patches.
